- package.json: tambah type module dan index.js ke files.
- hooks/*.js: rename ke .cjs + betulkan require internal agar tetap CommonJS di bawah type module; path require di testnan.mjs ikut disesuaikan.
Uji: import root + mock setup OK (skill+command terdaftar, hook context push 1). opencode reload: plugin list tampil testnan local index.js, log loading plugin sukses. python3 test/run.py: 6 tests OK.
